"An array of procedures that read the array's own region (C119): a knot
 through the store, which FX-26 refuses unless they say `spin`. KFX's
 check passed arrays over before."

(define f (poly ((r region)) (subr pure ((arrayof (subr (read r) () i64) r)) i64))
  (lambda (a) 0))

(define main (subr pure () string) (lambda () "x"))
